  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\nAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.\n\n## [Huskui.Avalonia@v1.3.0] - 2026-06-15\n\n### 🚀 Features\n\n- Add platform pseudoclasses to AppWindow, skip AcrylicMaterial on macOS\n- Add ModalActionPanel for platform-aware action button layout\n\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n- *(AppWindow)* Set platform pseudoclasses in instance constructor\n- Resolve Avalonia 12 build errors in AppWindow/PaginationControl themes\n\n### 🚜 Refactor\n\n- *(ModalActionPanel)* Orthogonalize Layout and PrimaryPlacement\n\n### ⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks\n\n- Migrate to per-package conventional commit auto-versioning\n\n<!-- generated by git-cliff -->",
